(* Native-text primitives. Checker/roundtrip stub; the native SML adapter is
   lib/subset_text_host.sml and the Workman target adapter is lib/subset_text_host.wm.
   The portable wrappers in SubsetChar and SubsetString validate inputs and outputs.

   `codes` reads a native string. `charCode`, `codeChar` and `fromCodes` convert byte
   characters and build a native string; their bodies here are the portable reference
   implementation, which adapters replace with constant-time host operations. *)
